{
  "_about": "The bodies build.py can make. 'like' takes another entry and changes what is named. '_base' holds the settings the gate's candidates shared and is not built itself. 'momentum-body' is the body the app ships, installed to public/models/ with --install: the athletic type with head A that the owner chose at the gate of block 7A, with the corrections of the second sheet — a surface without folds, and shorter, stronger arms held closer.",
